{"time":"2026-10-30T05:01:53.768Z","direction":"in","message":{"id":10,"result":{"result":{"type":"object","value":{"url":"http://127.0.0.1:8765/","title":"SRM Lite · 采购询价工作台","text":"S\nSRM\n采购业务系统\n询价 · 比价 · 定标\n工作空间\n询价项目\n物料与图纸\n供应商分配\n报价回收\n比价议价\n管理工具\n数据与备份\n字段设置\n 本地业务系统\n数据保存在本机\n询价与比价\nSRM 采购工作台\n演示数据不会保存；新建询价后可保存到本机。\n本机演示模式（不保存）\n询价项目\n数据与备份\n字段设置\n当前询价项目\n演示数据（不保存）\n保存状态待确认\n这是演示数据，不会保存。请新建一笔询价开始正式操作。\n采购业务流程\n① 询价项目\n② 物料与图纸\n③ 供应商分配\n④ 报价回收\n⑤ 比价议价\n01 / 询价项目\n询价项目\n下一步：物料与图纸\n\n01\n建立询价\n02\n准备清单\n03\n推进询价\n新建\n保存\n历史询价 \n选择已保存的其他询价\n打开所选历史询价\n修改内容自动保存；备份与恢复请前往“数据与备份”。","controls":[{"tag":"BUTTON","id":"","type":"button","text":"询价项目","value":"","disabled":false},{"tag":"BUTTON","id":"","type":"button","text":"物料与图纸","value":"","disabled":false},{"tag":"BUTTON","id":"","type":"button","text":"供应商分配","value":"","disabled":false},{"tag":"BUTTON","id":"","type":"button","text":"报价回收","value":"","disabled":false},{"tag":"BUTTON","id":"","type":"button","text":"比价议价","value":"","disabled":false},{"tag":"BUTTON","id":"","type":"button","text":"数据与备份","value":"","disabled":false},{"tag":"BUTTON","id":"","type":"button","text":"字段设置","value":"","disabled":false},{"tag":"BUTTON","id":"uiProjectJump","type":"button","text":"询价项目","value":"","disabled":false},{"tag":"BUTTON","id":"uiAdminToggle","type":"button","text":"数据与备份","value":"","disabled":false},{"tag":"BUTTON","id":"uiFieldSettings","type":"button","text":"字段设置","value":"","disabled":false},{"tag":"BUTTON","id":"","type":"submit","text":"① 询价项目","value":"","disabled":false},{"tag":"BUTTON","id":"","type":"submit","text":"② 物料与图纸","value":"","disabled":false},{"tag":"BUTTON","id":"","type":"submit","text":"③ 供应商分配","value":"","disabled":false},{"tag":"BUTTON","id":"","type":"submit","text":"④ 报价回收","value":"","disabled":false},{"tag":"BUTTON","id":"","type":"submit","text":"⑤ 比价议价","value":"","disabled":false},{"tag":"BUTTON","id":"","type":"button","text":"查看说明","value":"","disabled":false},{"tag":"BUT